  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given, the system of linear equations <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Now for system to be inconsistent,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>either&#160;of&#160;</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mo>&#8710;</mo><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mo>&#8710;</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>or</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mo>&#8710;</mo><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now calculating,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#916;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></math></p><p>Where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;so,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mo>&#8710;</mo><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#916;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, hence system is inconsistent at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
